					(thickness 0.15)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Safety" "NOT USB. Pad 1 is deliberately unconnected so a normal USB source VBUS does not enter the circuit. Pad 9 is physically present but has no PCB net or copper and must never be tied to board 3V3. Shell is mechanically anchored but electrically isolated. NOT PRODUCTION RELEASED."
